{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/c6841d32a527b415522bdd0576a30e1b.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/c6841d32a527b415522bdd0576a30e1b.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from a mysterious time loop! Embark on a journey of self-discovery and resilience. Delve into the enigmatic depths of the small godforsaken town: Rue Valley.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day feels like an uphill battle against the shadows of your own mind. Along the way, you will encounter a captivating ensemble of characters, each wrestling with their own emotional complexities and revealing hidden depths as you get to know them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you muster the courage to unravel the secrets of this temporal anomaly? Can you discover the strength within yourself to rise above adversity and forge a brighter tomorrow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/64260891d3089535d976f7898a285054.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/64260891d3089535d976f7898a285054.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own personality in Rue Valley. You can be a cold-hearted loner who overthinks everything or a melodramatic loudmouth who always trusts their gut instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you reflect your true personality or role-play someone entirely different, your character will shape your dialogues and interactions in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store memories in a graph, unlocking intentions and mindsets as you progress uniquely through the story. Commit to quirky mindsets for unexpected and hilarious dialogues, and experience personality-altering Status Effects: become more outgoing when drunk, or extra sensitive when anxious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different answers and timelines, because the loop will restart from the beginning anyway, won't it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/1ab3ab35d1ed847976ae4739018e756d.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/1ab3ab35d1ed847976ae4739018e756d.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2126190?t=1761054582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761054582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/9a4b4a8e89bfb06332856b28a200cc30809f732d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761054582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/9a4b4a8e89bfb06332856b28a200cc30809f732d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761054582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3546270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Movember &amp; Mental Health in Rue Valley</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/94f8681a3d1fe54edf1b115d0b9eb944.avif?t=1761054582\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mental health has been part of Rue Valley\u2019s story since day one. To treat the topic with care, our narrative team includes a medical professional and we\u2019ve done extensive research to ensure authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve also partnered with Movember, a global charity with over 20 years of experience in men\u2019s health. Together we aim to reduce stigma, normalize therapy, and share reliable information\u2014while keeping Rue Valley first and foremost a fun time-loop RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although Movember focuses on men\u2019s health, both Movember and Rue Valley welcome everyone. Mental health is important for all players, regardless of gender, age, or background.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/c6841d32a527b415522bdd0576a30e1b.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/c6841d32a527b415522bdd0576a30e1b.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from a mysterious time loop! Embark on a journey of self-discovery and resilience. Delve into the enigmatic depths of the small godforsaken town: Rue Valley.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day feels like an uphill battle against the shadows of your own mind. Along the way, you will encounter a captivating ensemble of characters, each wrestling with their own emotional complexities and revealing hidden depths as you get to know them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you muster the courage to unravel the secrets of this temporal anomaly? Can you discover the strength within yourself to rise above adversity and forge a brighter tomorrow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/64260891d3089535d976f7898a285054.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/64260891d3089535d976f7898a285054.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own personality in Rue Valley. You can be a cold-hearted loner who overthinks everything or a melodramatic loudmouth who always trusts their gut instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you reflect your true personality or role-play someone entirely different, your character will shape your dialogues and interactions in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store memories in a graph, unlocking intentions and mindsets as you progress uniquely through the story. Commit to quirky mindsets for unexpected and hilarious dialogues, and experience personality-altering Status Effects: become more outgoing when drunk, or extra sensitive when anxious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different answers and timelines, because the loop will restart from the beginning anyway, won't it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/1ab3ab35d1ed847976ae4739018e756d.poster.avif?t=1761054582\" width=1170 height=683 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/extras/1ab3ab35d1ed847976ae4739018e756d.webm?t=1761054582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Emotion Spark Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126190/51bfbdeb91235c4617c88639ddf32d5d046cf60b/header.jpg?t=1761054582","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Rue Valley \u00a92024 developed by Emotion Spark Studio. Published by Owlcat Games.<br />\r\nRue Valley, Emotion Spark Studio, and all associated logos, illustrations, images, names, locations, and characters, are trademarks and/or copyrights owned by Emotion Spark Games LTD. Owlcat Games is a trademark of Owlcat Games LTD. All rights reserved to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2126190/1155261763/b027c889372011aa1e4a7b832a7d6aa89024a544/1754473598/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755707136","d